<title>THAILAND: Bank of Asia Q3 net rises 39 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Asia Q3 net rises 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three months ending September 30.</p>
<p>		   (in million of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)			     1.05	vs	 0.87</p>
<p>    Net profit			   443.08	vs     318.91</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Bank of Asia Plc.</p>
